":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Scroller2d\/documentation\/Scroller2d\/GroundSection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" structure to define each object to be used by the Scroller2d engine or your own custom implementation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines a horizontal terrain section or the material in a gap."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"groundType"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ground"},{"type":"text","text":" for solid terrain, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"None"},{"type":"text","text":" for an empty span, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gap"},{"type":"text","text":" for a span filled with artwork. A gap’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distance"},{"type":"text","text":" sets the width and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"height of the artwork. The gap sprite has no floor collision."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a static fill, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" to an image name. For a two-frame wave, create"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sprite atlas named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"water_waves"},{"type":"text","text":" with images named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wave_01"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wave_02"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Give both frames matching dimensions and a consistent waterline. The helper"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays atlas frames in filename order. Configure playback in the section’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animation"},{"type":"text","text":" dictionary."}]},{"t